@v373 kernel.value.record "id" "4baac425126d6ed3e8ddfc4ad9d7500a2b0dae286f080c47dd68e1aeaf2570f5" "text" "Photosynthetic plants use light, water and carbon dioxide. A light requirement is typical of plants; it is not asserted here as a universal rule for all parasitic and nonphotosynthetic plants." "reference" $v372 "authorship" "Agent-authored paraphrase of the cited source."
